  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Lamb bhuna is a slowly reduced curry: lamb shoulder braised with spiced onion and tomato until the sauce has almost completely evaporated and the meat is coated in a sticky, concentrated paste. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "bhuna",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "bhuna"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " process requires patience and frequent stirring in the final stage to prevent the sauce from catching. The result is intensely flavoured and drier than most curries."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
